  "body_html": "<h1>VCG Truthfulness And Individual Rationality</h1>\n<p>Under the stated nonnegativity hypotheses, the VCG mechanism gives\nnonnegative truthful quasi-linear utility, is ex-post individually rational,\nand is dominant-strategy incentive compatible.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 9, Thm. 9.17] Nisan, Roughgarden, Tardos, and Vazirani,\n  <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>, <code>references/AlgorithmicGameTheory.pdf</code>. VCG\n  mechanisms are incentive compatible.</li>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 9, Lem. 9.20] Nisan, Roughgarden, Tardos, and Vazirani,\n  <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>, <code>references/AlgorithmicGameTheory.pdf</code>. Clarke\n  pivot payments and individual rationality under nonnegative valuations.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Provenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrated from EconCSLib pull request 27, old blueprint label\n  <code>thm:md_vcg_results</code> in <code>blueprint/src/content.tex</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
